    5  a footway ending 3 m short of the road, a fence along the road between them
    6  a residential road ending 3 m short of the road
    7  a footway off the road, round a spur, ending 3 m from the road 15 m along from where it left
    8  a footway off the road, round 500 m of field, ending 3 m from the road 100 m along
    9  no road: two footways end to end, 4 m apart
   10  a bridleway, and a footway ending 3 m short of it
   11  a private footway ending 3 m short of the road
   12  no road: two footways end to end, 8 m apart
   13  a footway beside the road, 6 m from it for 100 m, ending there
  osm2pgsql needs all nodes before all ways, each sorted by ID.
